  "equipment_type": "Sensor / controller (CO2 condensing unit gateway)",
  "applies_to": "Danfoss Optyma iCO2 CO2 condensing units (4.6 kW MT and 20 kW MT / 10 kW LT) through their Modbus gateway, software 1.0x.",
  "summary": "The Optyma iCO2 gateway exposes Danfoss's CO2 condensing units to a supervisor over RS-485 Modbus RTU. All values are single 16-bit holding registers addressed by PNU. This map covers the main switch, suction setpoint, day/night clock, high/receiver/suction pressures, temperatures, fan and compressor speed, valve openings and status.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": null,
    "baud": null,
    "parity": "Even",
    "data_bits": 8,
    "stop_bits": 1,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "1-based",
    "note": "The guide states every PNU is the register address plus 1: PNU 100 is requested as 0x63 (99)."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": "SW 1.0x",
  "source": {
    "title": "Programming Guide, Basic Modbus parameter list, Optyma iCO2 gateway (OP-MPAM015 and OP-MPAM005), SW Ver. 1.0x",
    "doc_number": "AU459739305217en-000201",
    "revision_date": "2024-08",
    "url": "https://assets.danfoss.com/documents/424639/AU459739305217en-000201.pdf",
    "pages": "pp. 3-4 (parameters), p. 5 (Modbus RTU information)"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Scale follows the 'Decimals' column: 1 decimal = value x10 on the wire (127 = 12.7), 2 decimals = x100. The SW version row has no decimals entry and is left unscaled.",
    "The list header says all values are in °C / bar(g), while the unit column prints °C/°F and bar/PSI. Units here follow the header.",
    "The alarm list (PNU 20000-20021) is left out: its PDF layout does not pair each alarm code with a PNU unambiguously.",
    "Baud rate switches automatically between 19200 and 38400; even parity, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit.",
    "Signedness is not printed; registers with negative minimums are listed as INT16."
  ],
